WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.363
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.633 --> 00:30.051
TAKE CHARGE OF MY HEART

3
00:39.644 --> 00:40.478
Okay.

4
00:40.562 --> 00:41.813
I will

5
00:43.189 --> 00:45.024
save you, Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

6
00:53.032 --> 00:55.785
Then move into my place tomorrow.

7
00:55.869 --> 00:57.579
Tomorrow? That soon?

8
00:58.705 --> 01:00.915
I need to tell my sister and brother.

9
01:00.999 --> 01:02.333
Give it a rest already.

10
01:02.417 --> 01:03.251
It's not fair.

11
01:03.918 --> 01:06.254
I wanted to eat that one.

12
01:06.337 --> 01:07.881
Just eat whatever.

13
01:07.964 --> 01:10.258
-Hide. -Why should I hide?

14
01:10.925 --> 01:14.137
-I said just eat whatever! -But I picked that one!

15
01:14.220 --> 01:15.597
Hey, Yong-gi!

16
01:15.680 --> 01:17.015
You're stressing me out.

17
01:17.098 --> 01:17.974
Huh?

18
01:18.725 --> 01:21.603
-What are you doing here? -Our baby sister is here!

19
01:21.686 --> 01:23.229
For our baby sister…

20
01:24.272 --> 01:26.566
Here, have this. It's the most expensive one.

21
01:26.649 --> 01:28.109
Sweet! It looks good.

22
01:30.028 --> 01:31.196
-Have you eaten? -Yeah.

23
01:31.279 --> 01:32.530
What about you guys?

24
01:33.031 --> 01:34.449
She wanted ice cream first.

25
01:34.532 --> 01:35.491
You haven't eaten?

26
01:35.575 --> 01:37.535
-We ate earlier. -You call that dinner?

27
01:37.619 --> 01:39.579
You scarfed it down. What's your problem?

28
01:39.662 --> 01:41.414
-Come on, guys. -Jeez.

29
01:58.932 --> 02:00.391
I'm here to pick you up.

30
02:07.690 --> 02:08.983
Is anything bothering you?

31
02:09.651 --> 02:10.568
Well…

32
02:11.110 --> 02:12.278
No, I just…

33
02:12.362 --> 02:14.989
I can't believe this is really happening.

34
02:16.366 --> 02:19.535
And I feel bad for lying to my sister and brother.

35
02:20.662 --> 02:24.123
The company's giving you a studio? Just like that?

36
02:24.207 --> 02:25.041
Yeah.

37
02:25.124 --> 02:27.961
I knew our Bo-bae would make it big someday.

38
02:28.920 --> 02:31.089
In three months, Na Ji-hye will be married,

39
02:31.172 --> 02:33.258
I'll be in Daejeon, and this home will be gone.

40
02:33.341 --> 02:35.677
Bo-bae, it all worked out, huh?

41
02:37.262 --> 02:39.472
You're not making this up, are you?

42
02:39.555 --> 02:42.517
Come on. Why would I make that up?

43
02:43.726 --> 02:45.144
I guess that's true.

44
02:46.813 --> 02:49.565
Thank you for making this difficult decision.

45
02:49.649 --> 02:52.110
If it weren't for you, Mr. Baek

46
02:52.944 --> 02:54.529
would've been in grave danger.

47
02:55.488 --> 02:56.614
Right.

48
02:56.698 --> 02:59.492
As for your role, Ms. Na Bo-bae,

49
03:00.410 --> 03:03.288
it is strictly limited to charging.

50
03:03.997 --> 03:05.081
Please keep that in mind.

51
03:06.082 --> 03:07.125
I will.

52
03:07.625 --> 03:11.504
Well… Mr. Yoon?

53
03:12.088 --> 03:12.922
Yes?

54
03:13.881 --> 03:18.052
Well, it sounds like Mr. Baek Ho-rang holds a very high position.

55
03:18.720 --> 03:20.888
What exactly does he do?

56
03:20.972 --> 03:23.808
He's the senior managing director of TS Resort.

57
03:23.891 --> 03:24.726
TS?

58
03:25.435 --> 03:26.811
That's a huge company.

59
03:27.770 --> 03:29.022
Senior managing director?

60
03:29.105 --> 03:31.566
Doesn't that basically make him a chaebol?

61
03:32.483 --> 03:35.695
More precisely, he's a third-generation chaebol.

62
04:01.596 --> 04:03.556
This is Mr. Baek Ho-rang's house?

63
04:03.639 --> 04:04.474
Yes.

64
04:06.851 --> 04:09.771
You'll be staying here for the next three months.

65
04:21.657 --> 04:22.617
We meet again.

66
04:24.243 --> 04:25.453
We do indeed.

67
04:26.371 --> 04:28.247
You shoved me into a corner yesterday.

68
04:29.374 --> 04:31.209
I thought you didn't want to see me.

69
04:31.292 --> 04:32.460
Well, it's just that…

70
04:32.960 --> 04:35.213
I didn't really know how to explain it.

71
04:35.296 --> 04:37.006
And you seem just fine.

72
04:40.551 --> 04:42.428
So petty.

73
05:19.090 --> 05:21.300
Your house is super nice.

74
05:22.009 --> 05:24.220
Can I take some pictures? For research.

75
05:24.303 --> 05:25.179
No, you can't.

76
05:25.263 --> 05:29.142
I won't show anyone. I'll never see a house like this again.

77
05:29.225 --> 05:31.602
If any photos get leaked, I'll sue you.

78
05:31.686 --> 05:33.020
So go ahead and take them.

79
05:34.355 --> 05:35.231
That's spot on.

80
05:35.314 --> 05:36.315
What is?

81
05:36.399 --> 05:37.942
You always see them in dramas.

82
05:38.025 --> 05:40.862
The man who shut himself off, scarred by a painful past,

83
05:40.945 --> 05:42.947
only to be changed by true love:

84
05:43.030 --> 05:45.533
the rude-ass third-gen chaebol heir.

85
05:45.616 --> 05:49.203
Sorry, but this is reality, not a drama.

86
05:49.287 --> 05:50.746
And "rude-ass"? What do you--

87
06:02.633 --> 06:04.635
Stop looking around and come here.

88
06:22.236 --> 06:25.239
This is as far as you're allowed.

89
06:25.323 --> 06:30.036
In other words, don't wander off anywhere else without…

90
06:37.376 --> 06:39.295
Looks like you eat pretty well.

91
06:39.378 --> 06:41.255
My housekeeper keeps it stocked for me.

92
06:41.339 --> 06:45.176
So chaebol have housekeepers, huh?

93
06:45.259 --> 06:47.470
How did you explain who I am to--

94
06:52.892 --> 06:53.809
Do I really

95
06:54.393 --> 06:55.228
have to explain?

96
06:56.229 --> 06:58.231
Well, I mean,

97
06:58.314 --> 07:00.399
we'll be running into each other a lot.

98
07:00.483 --> 07:02.610
That won't be necessary. Don't worry.

99
07:02.693 --> 07:03.945
Our arrangement

100
07:04.028 --> 07:07.156
stays strictly between us.

101
07:10.952 --> 07:12.912
Why did you put that on?

102
07:12.995 --> 07:13.955
Take it off.

103
07:36.686 --> 07:38.145
This is my room.

104
07:39.438 --> 07:42.275
It's bigger than my living room.

105
07:44.110 --> 07:47.154
Wow, this bed is massive.

106
07:52.702 --> 07:53.744
Feel free to lie down.

107
07:54.787 --> 07:55.621
What?

108
07:55.705 --> 07:59.250
If we're going to have physical contact, we'll have to share a bed at times.

109
08:02.420 --> 08:04.755
Why would we have physical contact in bed?

110
08:04.839 --> 08:07.800
Would you rather do it in public?

111
08:29.363 --> 08:30.656
Actually…

112
08:32.700 --> 08:33.701
I need…

113
08:37.872 --> 08:39.290
a recharge now.

114
08:53.304 --> 08:54.805
What are you doing?

115
08:59.977 --> 09:01.103
My room.

116
09:01.646 --> 09:02.938
I want to see my room.

117
09:12.907 --> 09:13.949
Wait.

118
09:14.033 --> 09:16.452
I want to see my room. Why are we back outside?

119
09:19.080 --> 09:19.914
Huh?

120
09:30.549 --> 09:34.178
This is where you'll be staying from now on.

121
09:35.388 --> 09:36.222
What?

122
09:43.229 --> 09:44.355
But this is

123
09:44.980 --> 09:46.315
a storage room.

124
09:47.733 --> 09:49.318
This is your room.

125
09:52.988 --> 09:54.824
Why put me here when you have that nice…

126
09:54.907 --> 09:57.910
Charging my heart is the whole point of our contract.

127
09:57.993 --> 10:01.372
It's exactly ten meters from here to my room.

128
10:01.455 --> 10:04.500
So charging shouldn't be a problem.

129
10:04.583 --> 10:06.419
There's no need for us to live together.

130
10:06.502 --> 10:07.837
-But-- -Come on.

131
10:07.920 --> 10:09.296
Let's go over our contract.

132
10:37.241 --> 10:38.159
Well…

133
10:38.242 --> 10:41.954
-If you want, I can redecorate-- -I do.

134
10:48.210 --> 10:49.086
Have a seat.

135
11:00.806 --> 11:02.266
Look it over.

136
11:05.644 --> 11:07.772
SENIOR MANAGING DIRECTOR BAEK HO-RANG

137
11:09.690 --> 11:10.524
What?

138
11:12.485 --> 11:14.361
This whole thing is the contract?

139
11:14.445 --> 11:15.988
My life is at stake here.

140
11:16.071 --> 11:19.033
-This is the bare minimum. -How am I supposed to read all this?

141
11:19.116 --> 11:21.243
I've only listed my terms so far.

142
11:21.327 --> 11:23.829
You can add yours now.

143
11:27.500 --> 11:30.127
"Na Bo-bae shall charge Baek Ho-rang's artificial heart

144
11:30.211 --> 11:32.213
every morning at 7:30…

145
11:35.466 --> 11:37.718
by holding his hand."

146
11:37.802 --> 11:41.764
I'm never up before 10:00, especially after writing all night.

147
11:41.847 --> 11:44.350
I work in an office. I start at 8:30.

148
11:44.433 --> 11:48.020
This is the only way I can fully charge and stick to my morning routine.

149
11:51.816 --> 11:53.400
"Under normal circumstances,

150
11:53.484 --> 11:57.696
Baek Ho-rang shall not request any method of recharging other than hand-holding."

151
11:57.780 --> 12:01.450
"However, if the battery level falls below 10%,

152
12:01.534 --> 12:05.830
Na Bo-bae shall, without exception, through close physical contact…"

153
12:06.997 --> 12:08.082
"Close"?

154
12:11.043 --> 12:13.087
What constitutes "close physical contact"?

155
12:13.170 --> 12:17.007
Contact between mucosal surfaces.

156
12:19.051 --> 12:19.885
What?

157
12:19.969 --> 12:20.803
Well…

158
12:22.221 --> 12:24.473
Like kissing or…

159
12:25.349 --> 12:26.517
something beyond that.

160
12:28.686 --> 12:31.355
In any case, it only applies in emergencies

161
12:31.438 --> 12:33.107
when the battery drops below 10%.

162
12:33.190 --> 12:34.024
Oh.

163
12:35.943 --> 12:37.736
I mean, we'll be living together.

164
12:37.820 --> 12:41.949
It's not like the battery will ever drop below 10%, right?

165
12:42.032 --> 12:43.284
I agree.

166
12:43.367 --> 12:45.494
It's just a formality. Don't worry.

167
12:45.995 --> 12:47.663
And I have no desire

168
12:47.746 --> 12:49.790
to have "close" physical contact

169
12:49.874 --> 12:51.458
with you, Ms. Na Bo-bae.

170
12:51.542 --> 12:52.543
That's great.

171
12:52.626 --> 12:55.296
If it weren't for my script,

172
12:55.379 --> 12:57.715
I wouldn't even share a table with you.

173
12:58.215 --> 12:59.466
If you say so.

174
13:05.389 --> 13:06.974
Where do I add my terms?

175
13:19.695 --> 13:21.655
DO ONE ROMANCE BUCKET LIST ITEM EACH WEEK

176
13:21.739 --> 13:23.532
"Romance bucket list"?

177
13:23.616 --> 13:27.620
There are a few dates I want to write into my script.

178
13:28.329 --> 13:33.250
I'm just a teensy bit weaker on the romance front,

179
13:33.876 --> 13:36.670
so I wanted to experience it before I write it.

180
13:37.171 --> 13:40.299
It's nice and clear. Share the list with me later.

181
13:40.382 --> 13:41.300
Sure.

182
13:42.343 --> 13:44.386
The next one is right below it.

183
13:46.180 --> 13:48.724
"During this agreement, neither Na Bo-bae nor Baek Ho-rang

184
13:48.807 --> 13:51.060
shall see anyone of the opposite gender,

185
13:51.143 --> 13:54.188
and shall be sincere with one another."

186
13:55.397 --> 13:57.399
I wasn't planning on seeing anyone anyway.

187
13:57.983 --> 14:01.654
You sure you don't have a boyfriend?

188
14:01.737 --> 14:03.447
I told you, I don't.

189
14:03.530 --> 14:05.407
You're all I have.

190
14:10.079 --> 14:11.205
What I'm saying is…

191
14:12.289 --> 14:16.126
I didn't mean you're all I have in that way.

192
14:16.710 --> 14:17.836
As a man.

193
14:18.420 --> 14:20.506
You're the only man I've got?

194
14:20.589 --> 14:22.466
Okay, I get what you mean.

195
14:22.549 --> 14:23.550
Yeah.

196
14:24.718 --> 14:25.636
I get it.

197
14:31.809 --> 14:33.894
-We're all set now, right? -Yes.

198
14:35.437 --> 14:36.647
One more thing.

199
14:37.231 --> 14:39.525
I'll be the one to initiate charging.

200
14:39.608 --> 14:41.527
Whether it's holding hands, hugging,

201
14:42.736 --> 14:44.738
or close physical contact.

202
14:44.822 --> 14:48.325
Since my body is the charger, I'll decide when and how it happens.

203
14:48.409 --> 14:49.368
All right.

204
14:50.536 --> 14:52.413
I'll revise it accordingly.

205
14:57.459 --> 14:58.335
Oh, right.

206
14:59.586 --> 15:01.005
After we sign,

207
15:02.006 --> 15:03.924
we'll test the charging rate.

208
15:04.925 --> 15:05.759
Is that okay?

209
15:06.552 --> 15:08.220
Yes, that's fine.

210
15:08.303 --> 15:12.558
We'll have to hold hands, hug,

211
15:12.641 --> 15:14.018
and maybe…

212
15:16.020 --> 15:17.271
even do more.

213
15:19.356 --> 15:21.567
I mean, it's just a test.

214
15:22.067 --> 15:23.110
It's fine.

215
15:24.445 --> 15:25.362
All right.

216
15:26.030 --> 15:28.490
I'll take that as a yes.

217
15:54.892 --> 15:56.769
MY SIS

218
15:59.021 --> 15:59.855
Hey, Ji-hye.

219
15:59.938 --> 16:02.191
Hey, are you at the studio?

220
16:02.274 --> 16:03.609
How is it? Is it okay?

221
16:03.692 --> 16:05.694
Oh, this place?

222
16:06.236 --> 16:08.489
It's really nice.

223
16:08.572 --> 16:12.451
It's spacious, and it's got all the latest equipment.

224
16:14.620 --> 16:16.538
And it's got an amazing view.

225
16:17.039 --> 16:19.583
Since the TV station arranged the studio for you,

226
16:19.666 --> 16:21.293
we probably shouldn't go, right?

227
16:21.794 --> 16:22.920
You okay living alone?

228
16:23.003 --> 16:25.964
Of course I am.

229
16:26.465 --> 16:30.094
I see this as my last chance.

230
16:30.719 --> 16:32.846
I really want to make it.

231
16:32.930 --> 16:35.265
I want to see my name on a drama,

232
16:35.349 --> 16:38.811
and I want to proudly call myself a drama writer.

233
16:39.478 --> 16:45.317
I don't want to feel small and ashamed of my scripts anymore.

234
16:45.400 --> 16:49.446
Tell me if anyone looks down on you. They won't get away with it.

235
16:49.530 --> 16:52.366
Don't worry about anything else. Just focus on writing, okay?

236
16:52.449 --> 16:55.244
Now all you have to do is become a star writer, Na Bo-bae.

237
16:56.495 --> 16:57.579
All right.

238
16:57.663 --> 16:58.789
Is it Bo-bae?

239
16:58.872 --> 17:00.290
Go away.

240
17:00.374 --> 17:02.334
Bo-bae! Our Bo-bae is the best!

241
17:02.417 --> 17:04.002
-Stop! -You're Korea's best writer!

242
17:04.837 --> 17:05.838
I said go away. Go.

243
17:05.921 --> 17:09.633
Ji-hye, I have to go. I need to work on my script.

244
17:09.716 --> 17:11.301
Okay. Hey, Bo-bae.

245
17:11.385 --> 17:12.344
Yeah?

246
17:13.011 --> 17:15.013
Give it your best shot.

247
17:15.514 --> 17:17.599
But if things get tough, you can always come back.

248
17:17.683 --> 17:18.684
You know that, right?

249
17:20.727 --> 17:22.396
Yeah, of course.

250
17:23.730 --> 17:24.690
Okay.

251
17:35.159 --> 17:36.076
That's right.

252
17:37.995 --> 17:40.372
I should at least give it my best shot.

253
18:10.527 --> 18:12.779
ROMANCE DRAMA WRITING TECHNIQUES

254
19:18.762 --> 19:22.557
Charging starts at 7:30 every morning. It's already 7:40.

255
19:22.641 --> 19:24.476
I'm sorry.

256
19:25.269 --> 19:27.521
Morning charging is just holding hands, right?

257
19:27.604 --> 19:30.691
Be on time from now on. I can't stand people breaking the rules.

258
19:30.774 --> 19:33.318
It's clearly stated in the contract.

259
19:33.402 --> 19:34.778
Fine.

260
19:34.861 --> 19:36.154
Here.

261
20:00.637 --> 20:04.099
I'll come straight home after work. We'll test the charging rate tonight.

262
20:06.393 --> 20:07.394
Are you crazy?

263
20:08.020 --> 20:09.896
I told you to wait six months!

264
20:09.980 --> 20:13.233
We just signed a contract last month. Why'd you go and sign another?

265
20:13.817 --> 20:16.653
Are you trying to get caught?

266
20:16.737 --> 20:18.739
-My head's killing me. -My apologies.

267
20:24.286 --> 20:25.954
I guess our VP was in a hurry.

268
20:26.038 --> 20:27.122
TS HOTEL FOOD SUPPLY CONTRACT

269
20:27.205 --> 20:28.457
A mistake like this? Really?

270
20:28.540 --> 20:30.542
Yoon Dong-seok!

271
20:30.625 --> 20:33.754
Do you have any idea how important this is?

272
20:33.837 --> 20:35.881
Imagine if my husband finds out.

273
20:35.964 --> 20:38.383
You won't be leaving in one piece!

274
20:38.467 --> 20:40.260
My deepest apologies, ma'am.

275
20:40.344 --> 20:42.596
Hey, Baek. You'll get wrinkles from frowning.

276
20:42.679 --> 20:45.182
"Hey, Baek"? Is that any way to address your mother?

277
20:45.766 --> 20:47.601
You think this doesn't concern you?

278
20:47.684 --> 20:50.812
Baek Ho-rang's successor announcement is on hold.

279
20:50.896 --> 20:53.440
This is our chance to get ahead.

280
20:53.523 --> 20:55.776
If they find out we messed with the money,

281
20:55.859 --> 20:57.277
we're toast.

282
20:57.778 --> 20:59.279
As you can see,

283
20:59.363 --> 21:03.950
Mr. Ji Eun-ho landed his first lead role with Ms. Na's debut work, Wistful Youth.

284
21:07.120 --> 21:09.081
Well, you're a fan.

285
21:09.164 --> 21:11.625
That's why you're so nice about my work.

286
21:12.125 --> 21:13.919
That damn romance.

287
21:14.795 --> 21:17.130
So that was Ji Eun-ho.

288
21:17.214 --> 21:19.341
He only backed out of the meeting

289
21:19.424 --> 21:21.551
because Ms. Na was hospitalized.

290
21:22.511 --> 21:24.471
If we can get Ms. Na on our side first…

291
21:24.554 --> 21:25.555
Hold on, sir.

292
21:25.639 --> 21:27.432
-Please don't. -His schedule is full.

293
21:27.516 --> 21:29.518
If you can schedule a meeting later…

294
21:29.601 --> 21:30.894
Wait, sir! You can't…

295
21:33.855 --> 21:34.689
Hey.

296
21:35.774 --> 21:37.025
You think you own this place?

297
21:43.281 --> 21:46.076
Sir, Mr. Baek has an appointment shortly.

298
21:46.785 --> 21:48.036
If you could set up--

299
21:48.120 --> 21:50.163
I was passing by and thought I'd drop in.

300
21:50.831 --> 21:53.375
Thought I'd come see my dear cousin.

301
21:55.836 --> 21:57.337
It's your birthday soon.

302
21:57.921 --> 21:59.339
Want anything?

303
22:00.006 --> 22:02.717
Since when do you care about my birthday?

304
22:03.301 --> 22:04.678
Get out. I'm busy.

305
22:04.761 --> 22:07.347
Come on. Everyone here is busy.

306
22:07.431 --> 22:11.017
You always act like you're so important and busy.

307
22:11.101 --> 22:13.103
Hey, Kim.

308
22:13.186 --> 22:15.105
Get me an iced Americano. Extra shot.

309
22:15.188 --> 22:16.356
He's Mr. Yoon.

310
22:17.190 --> 22:18.024
Don't bring it.

311
22:21.027 --> 22:24.614
If you want coffee, go to a café. If you want to have fun, go to a club.

312
22:26.450 --> 22:30.036
No one's got time for you here.

313
22:43.008 --> 22:43.842
Mom.

314
22:48.972 --> 22:50.223
I'm certain.

315
22:52.851 --> 22:54.478
He doesn't know yet.

316
23:07.574 --> 23:09.910
Your name came up during the table read with Director Yeom.

317
23:09.993 --> 23:13.830
-Is she messing with me? -So I thought I'd text. Good luck!

318
23:21.338 --> 23:25.926
Thanks, Ju-hee… Hope your drama blows up…

319
23:30.639 --> 23:33.558
I'm the one who needs to blow up.

320
23:36.937 --> 23:40.315
This is seriously driving me nuts.

321
23:55.455 --> 23:56.331
No.

322
23:57.791 --> 23:59.501
I don't have time for this.

323
24:14.307 --> 24:16.935
I've been waiting for you, Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

324
24:22.232 --> 24:24.651
"Romance Bucket List."

325
24:25.610 --> 24:28.154
"Drink together until late at night."

326
24:28.238 --> 24:30.824
"Late-night walk by the Hangang River."

327
24:30.907 --> 24:33.076
"Nighttime theme park date."

328
24:33.868 --> 24:36.246
Did I overdo the whole nighttime thing?

329
24:36.329 --> 24:38.373
-Do we have to do them in order? -No.

330
24:38.456 --> 24:39.791
That doesn't matter.

331
24:39.874 --> 24:40.834
DO A CHAEBOL FLEX

332
24:40.917 --> 24:42.419
"Chaebol flex"?

333
24:43.587 --> 24:44.421
What's this?

334
24:47.007 --> 24:50.844
My female lead's a third-gen chaebol facing an assassination threat.

335
24:50.927 --> 24:53.013
The male lead is assigned as her bodyguard.

336
24:53.096 --> 24:54.973
As they slowly fall in love--

337
24:55.056 --> 24:56.182
Just the bottom line.

338
24:58.101 --> 25:00.979
I heard you were a chaebol. Let's see you splash the cash.

339
25:02.355 --> 25:04.649
Isn't that kind of cliché and childish?

340
25:05.275 --> 25:07.235
Why is every drama about chaebols

341
25:07.319 --> 25:10.322
when there aren't even a hundred conglomerates in Korea?

342
25:10.947 --> 25:12.574
Go ahead. Laugh all you want.

343
25:13.241 --> 25:16.036
I know the chaebol fantasies in romance dramas

344
25:16.119 --> 25:18.038
are far-fetched and childish.

345
25:18.121 --> 25:19.414
Still,

346
25:21.041 --> 25:22.125
they're fun.

347
25:22.208 --> 25:23.877
Enough to keep people coming back.

348
25:26.463 --> 25:29.090
It doesn't matter if it's cliché and childish.

349
25:29.174 --> 25:33.345
When you're watching something fun, you forget everything else.

350
25:34.471 --> 25:38.141
The hardships, the loneliness, the pain.

351
25:39.100 --> 25:45.190
When you're watching something really fun, it whisks you away to another world.

352
25:45.690 --> 25:48.360
Do you know how incredible that is?

353
25:49.444 --> 25:54.407
Look, I'll do everything you need. The tests, the actual charging, all of it.

354
25:54.991 --> 25:58.745
In return, I want your full cooperation with my romance.

355
26:00.121 --> 26:02.582
Of course. We have a contract.

356
26:02.666 --> 26:06.461
Let's start the charging rate test. And then we'll cross one thing off

357
26:07.504 --> 26:08.421
your bucket list.

358
26:10.882 --> 26:12.133
RUBBER GLOVE

359
26:15.679 --> 26:18.473
Isn't it done yet? It's been about ten minutes.

360
26:22.560 --> 26:25.188
HO-RANG'S ROOM STORAGE ROOM

361
26:30.944 --> 26:31.945
PORTABLE CHARGER

362
26:32.028 --> 26:34.906
So it does charge 1% every ten minutes.

363
26:34.989 --> 26:35.990
All right. Next.

364
26:36.074 --> 26:37.200
CHARGING RATE TEST

365
26:40.912 --> 26:42.872
So? How much did it drop?

366
26:44.708 --> 26:46.334
When you're in the garage,

367
26:46.418 --> 26:49.254
charging only works as far as my room.

368
26:49.337 --> 26:51.464
BACKYARD GARAGE

369
26:51.548 --> 26:55.260
And it seems to drop 1% every 15 minutes.

370
26:59.848 --> 27:00.807
If we're close,

371
27:00.890 --> 27:04.853
charging seems to take only seven or eight minutes.

372
27:05.645 --> 27:08.606
It's not very consistent, is it?

373
27:09.274 --> 27:11.985
It seems to vary with my condition and heart rate.

374
27:12.068 --> 27:15.238
We'd have to test different levels of physical contact…

375
27:20.827 --> 27:23.079
to know for sure.

376
27:23.163 --> 27:23.997
Oh.

377
27:24.706 --> 27:28.543
Different levels of physical contact. Right. We should test that.

378
27:29.043 --> 27:30.128
Holding hands?

379
27:43.892 --> 27:44.934
All right.

380
27:45.018 --> 27:47.729
Holding hands brings it up by 5%.

381
27:50.565 --> 27:51.691
Next would be…

382
27:53.693 --> 27:54.527
Let's try hugging.

383
27:54.611 --> 27:55.862
Yeah. Sure.

384
28:06.706 --> 28:08.124
Did I jump in too fast?

385
28:21.346 --> 28:23.306
Why is it beeping?

386
28:24.349 --> 28:25.558
A heart rate of 100?

387
28:25.642 --> 28:26.643
It's nothing!

388
28:27.185 --> 28:28.645
I mean, this…

389
28:31.231 --> 28:34.567
It probably charged up too fast.

390
28:38.446 --> 28:40.615
Hugging increases it by 10%.

391
28:48.456 --> 28:49.290
Well,

392
28:50.458 --> 28:51.626
I guess

393
28:52.460 --> 28:54.045
next would be

394
28:54.921 --> 28:56.172
kissing, right?

395
29:12.856 --> 29:14.858
As for kissing,

396
29:15.358 --> 29:16.943
I don't think we need to do that now.

397
29:17.026 --> 29:18.653
-Right? Yeah. -Yes.

398
29:18.736 --> 29:20.530
I wasn't that curious anyway.

399
29:20.613 --> 29:22.490
I did kind of prepare myself for it.

400
29:22.574 --> 29:25.285
But if we don't, we don't.

401
29:26.703 --> 29:29.122
-Sounds like you want to. -No way.

402
29:29.205 --> 29:30.790
Why would I? Not at all.

403
29:36.087 --> 29:37.463
You should get that.

404
29:41.175 --> 29:42.135
Yes, Mr. Yoon.

405
29:43.511 --> 29:44.345
Yes.

406
29:46.347 --> 29:47.181
Yeah.

407
29:50.768 --> 29:51.853
Yeah.

408
29:52.770 --> 29:53.646
Yeah, go ahead.

409
29:54.814 --> 29:57.275
Okay. I'll check. All right.

410
29:59.485 --> 30:01.779
Why are you grabbing my hand like that?

411
30:03.156 --> 30:03.990
Oh.

412
30:04.741 --> 30:05.742
I'm sorry.

413
30:08.244 --> 30:11.414
I thought we were doing your bucket list today.

414
30:12.332 --> 30:13.291
Oh.

415
30:23.760 --> 30:25.470
SENIOR MANAGING DIRECTOR BAEK HO-RANG

416
30:41.277 --> 30:42.153
Yes.

417
30:43.488 --> 30:46.658
I just got off the phone with Mr. Baek.

418
30:58.795 --> 31:01.714
The night air feels so nice.

419
31:03.091 --> 31:04.342
It's humid.

420
31:08.554 --> 31:09.597
Damn it.

421
31:09.681 --> 31:12.892
If this were a drama, now would be the perfect time to hold his hand.

422
31:13.935 --> 31:16.145
Should I say it's for the script and do it?

423
31:30.618 --> 31:32.620
Is this really on your bucket list?

424
31:32.704 --> 31:33.538
Sorry?

425
31:34.163 --> 31:37.125
We're just walking. Even in a drama, this would be boring.

426
31:39.085 --> 31:39.919
Well…

427
31:41.462 --> 31:43.673
Night walks have a certain romance, you know.

428
31:44.507 --> 31:47.010
Like, there's this tingly tension

429
31:47.093 --> 31:50.430
when you're almost touching, but not quite--

430
32:19.125 --> 32:20.460
That was close.

431
32:22.003 --> 32:23.755
I'm fine.

432
32:24.297 --> 32:25.381
I'm not.

433
32:25.465 --> 32:27.884
I don't think I got hit,

434
32:27.967 --> 32:29.552
but my heart rate's way up.

435
32:30.178 --> 32:32.430
That can't be good for my heart.

436
32:32.513 --> 32:34.390
It's dark out and he didn't even ring--

437
32:34.474 --> 32:36.434
What's the damn bell for, decoration?

438
32:36.517 --> 32:39.395
What if Mr. Baek got hurt in an accident this late at night?

439
32:39.479 --> 32:41.606
Does he think he owns the Hangang River?

440
32:44.859 --> 32:45.693
Why are you…

441
32:45.777 --> 32:48.696
Enough walking. Let's grab a bite and head home.

442
32:57.663 --> 32:59.290
Does he only care about himself?

443
32:59.373 --> 33:01.125
Romance, my ass.

444
33:01.626 --> 33:03.753
A romance? With a guy like him?

445
33:13.513 --> 33:15.306
All right. Here's your food.

446
33:15.389 --> 33:17.058
Thank you.

447
33:17.141 --> 33:18.184
Enjoy.

448
33:18.267 --> 33:19.602
Thank you.

449
33:20.394 --> 33:22.105
Looks yummy.

450
33:24.524 --> 33:26.567
There's so much. You sure you don't want any?

451
33:29.362 --> 33:30.571
No, I'm good.

452
33:31.072 --> 33:34.283
You've never had chicken feet before?

453
33:34.367 --> 33:36.494
How can I eat something that looks like this?

454
33:36.577 --> 33:39.080
It might not look appetizing, but it's really good.

455
33:39.163 --> 33:41.249
-Like pig trotters. -I don't eat those either.

456
33:43.417 --> 33:47.338
They've been serving chicken feet for three generations.

457
33:47.421 --> 33:49.632
This is seriously good.

458
33:50.341 --> 33:52.176
It's good for your health too.

459
33:52.260 --> 33:53.719
It's practically medicine.

460
33:53.803 --> 33:56.848
How can something this spicy and salty be medicine?

461
33:56.931 --> 33:59.142
-You're just fooling yourself. -Yeah, I am.

462
33:59.225 --> 34:00.810
So what? It still tastes good.

463
34:06.232 --> 34:07.859
Seriously, it's so good.

464
34:08.568 --> 34:11.112
Look. If you dip it in the sauce like this…

465
34:26.544 --> 34:27.461
Want some, huh?

466
34:27.545 --> 34:29.172
No way. I don't want any.

467
34:33.092 --> 34:34.218
Then

468
34:34.927 --> 34:36.345
just try the end.

469
34:36.429 --> 34:38.306
-I'll cut it off for you. -In that case…

470
34:39.182 --> 34:40.474
No foot shape.

471
34:41.601 --> 34:42.727
Seriously.

472
34:48.316 --> 34:49.400
Here.

473
35:04.081 --> 35:04.916
Isn't it good?

474
35:05.583 --> 35:06.459
It's good, right?

475
35:07.335 --> 35:10.004
I guess it's not bad.

476
35:35.112 --> 35:38.616
Do you know how they make these boneless chicken feet?

477
35:39.116 --> 35:39.951
No, I don't.

478
35:40.034 --> 35:45.831
The owner gnaws the bones out one by one, like this.

479
35:46.916 --> 35:49.710
That's how he makes them boneless.

480
35:49.794 --> 35:52.296
How's everything? Good?

481
35:54.465 --> 35:55.508
Enjoy.

482
36:01.347 --> 36:02.390
He's got strong teeth.

483
36:09.855 --> 36:11.274
I was just kidding.

484
36:24.537 --> 36:26.664
All right, then. Go on in.

485
36:27.748 --> 36:30.835
Bet you'll sleep well tonight after that big meal.

486
36:31.836 --> 36:32.670
Good night.

487
36:34.505 --> 36:36.424
Don't forget about the hospital tomorrow.

488
36:46.642 --> 36:48.894
The Hangang River date.

489
36:48.978 --> 36:52.982
Better do it before I forget. Quick.

490
36:55.318 --> 36:58.237
Hye-ju and I-hyeok walk

491
36:58.321 --> 37:01.782
side by side along the Hangang River.

492
37:03.701 --> 37:05.202
THEIR HANDS ALMOST BRUSH

493
37:05.286 --> 37:08.622
THE TWO ARE ACUTELY AWARE OF EACH OTHER

494
37:43.199 --> 37:44.158
Ma'am.

495
37:44.241 --> 37:45.284
(HOLDING HER IN HIS ARMS)

496
37:45.368 --> 37:46.410
Are you all right?

497
37:48.162 --> 37:49.372
Yeah.

498
37:49.455 --> 37:51.332
Are you sure you don't need to go to the hospital?

499
37:51.957 --> 37:52.792
I'm okay.

500
37:52.875 --> 37:54.377
(TREMBLING)

501
37:55.127 --> 37:56.128
(STARTLED)

502
37:56.212 --> 37:57.505
You're bleeding!

503
37:59.632 --> 38:03.052
I-HYEOK HIDES HIS WOUND AS IF IT'S NOTHING

504
38:03.135 --> 38:06.180
As long as you're not hurt, I'm fine.

505
38:08.516 --> 38:14.397
I-HYEOK GAZES AT HYE-JU WISTFULLY

506
38:16.690 --> 38:18.192
That's it. That's more like it.

507
38:18.275 --> 38:19.735
He likes her,

508
38:19.819 --> 38:22.613
so he doesn't care if he gets hurt as long as she's okay.

509
38:23.239 --> 38:24.573
I'm fine.

510
38:24.657 --> 38:25.533
I'm not.

511
38:25.616 --> 38:26.992
I don't think I got hit.

512
38:27.076 --> 38:28.661
That can't be good for my heart.

513
38:31.622 --> 38:33.874
Real life is nothing like the dramas.

514
39:00.067 --> 39:02.361
How about changing your sleep pattern?

515
39:03.279 --> 39:05.448
I was in the zone last night.

516
39:05.531 --> 39:07.867
It was like I was possessed.

517
39:08.451 --> 39:11.370
They say great writers write a set amount every day,

518
39:11.454 --> 39:13.664
no matter how they feel.

519
39:13.747 --> 39:17.710
Yeah, well, I'm still just a lousy rookie writer.

520
39:20.671 --> 39:21.505
What's the matter?

521
39:40.274 --> 39:41.150
It's nothing.

522
39:59.543 --> 40:00.878
I'll handle it.

523
40:06.050 --> 40:07.134
Ma'am.

524
40:07.218 --> 40:08.302
-Yes? -Excuse me.

525
40:08.385 --> 40:09.929
May I see your phone?

526
40:10.012 --> 40:11.222
Why?

527
40:11.305 --> 40:12.723
I heard a camera click.

528
40:12.806 --> 40:14.934
Just making sure you didn't take a photo of us.

529
40:15.017 --> 40:16.101
What?

530
40:16.185 --> 40:18.020
Why would I take a photo of you people?

531
40:18.103 --> 40:19.813
I'm just being careful.

532
40:19.897 --> 40:22.316
-Please excuse me. -No!

533
40:22.942 --> 40:24.777
What's Mr. Yoon doing?

534
40:24.860 --> 40:27.404
He's checking whether she took a picture of me.

535
40:27.488 --> 40:29.823
What? Why would she take a picture of you?

536
40:29.907 --> 40:33.410
She could be a paparazzo or a reporter in disguise.

537
40:33.494 --> 40:34.537
What?

538
40:34.620 --> 40:38.624
Listen, we're not even allowed to use our phones while we're working!

539
40:38.707 --> 40:40.751
Isn't this a bit much?

540
40:40.834 --> 40:42.628
Keep your opinions to yourself.

541
40:44.380 --> 40:47.174
People are watching. Talk to her somewhere quiet.

542
40:56.433 --> 40:57.434
No!

543
41:38.892 --> 41:39.727
Sir?

544
41:41.103 --> 41:42.980
Sir!

545
41:43.063 --> 41:47.735
Seriously, I swear I didn't take any photos.

546
41:48.319 --> 41:49.320
Look.

547
41:51.488 --> 41:54.408
We're not allowed to use our phones while we're cleaning,

548
41:54.491 --> 41:57.119
but I was texting my daughter.

549
41:57.703 --> 41:59.204
That's why I couldn't show him.

550
42:00.122 --> 42:02.124
Do you think he'll report me?

551
42:02.708 --> 42:04.835
They've gone to report me, right?

552
42:06.295 --> 42:08.756
Just explain what happened. I'll talk to them too.

553
42:08.839 --> 42:10.924
Thank you, I appreciate it.

554
42:11.008 --> 42:13.427
I didn't take any photos. He just came up to me.

555
42:30.361 --> 42:33.822
You took off like something happened, yet here you are,

556
42:34.323 --> 42:35.157
just chilling.

557
42:36.075 --> 42:37.201
Go check on the cleaner.

558
42:38.869 --> 42:39.870
Yes, sir.

559
42:39.953 --> 42:42.414
I checked her phone. There were no photos of you.

560
42:42.498 --> 42:43.832
Mr. Yoon, go check it.

561
42:44.750 --> 42:46.752
Yes, sir. Understood.

562
42:51.465 --> 42:54.760
Do you always go around accusing people and saying whatever you want?

563
42:54.843 --> 42:57.680
That's OCD, paranoia, or something like that.

564
42:57.763 --> 42:59.348
It's your problem.

565
42:59.431 --> 43:00.599
Well,

566
43:00.683 --> 43:02.768
now that you're here, have a seat.

567
43:07.648 --> 43:10.734
I heard you and Ho-rang tested the charging rate.

568
43:11.735 --> 43:16.865
Since it's not exactly normal for a person to charge an artificial heart,

569
43:16.949 --> 43:22.329
I'd like to run a few tests to make sure nothing's wrong with you.

570
43:22.413 --> 43:23.247
Right.

571
43:23.330 --> 43:25.582
We're here for different tests.

572
43:25.666 --> 43:27.459
Did you have to call us in together?

573
43:27.543 --> 43:30.629
I don't want to be around some power-tripping narcissist either.

574
43:31.755 --> 43:33.132
Can I go get my tests now?

575
43:33.215 --> 43:34.425
-Well… -Ms. Na.

576
43:34.508 --> 43:36.802
You don't know my story, so watch what you say.

577
43:36.885 --> 43:39.888
Don't act like your bad manners come with some backstory.

578
43:39.972 --> 43:44.518
You think you're some paragon of virtue?

579
43:44.601 --> 43:48.021
It's always the ones with character flaws who ask that.

580
43:48.105 --> 43:50.149
-Ms. Na Bo-bae! -What, Mr. Baek Ho-rang?

581
43:51.400 --> 43:52.609
Excuse me, you two.

582
43:52.693 --> 43:54.528
-Let's do the tests! -Where do I go?

583
44:04.079 --> 44:06.999
Did you have heart surgery? That's a big scar.

584
44:07.958 --> 44:11.545
I was struck by lightning when I was a kid.

585
44:11.628 --> 44:12.546
It's from that.

586
44:12.629 --> 44:15.340
-Lightning? -Yeah. Pretty unusual, right?

587
44:15.924 --> 44:17.050
Yes, it is.

588
44:20.012 --> 44:22.181
I checked, but there were no photos of you.

589
44:22.681 --> 44:24.224
No deleted photos either.

590
44:29.062 --> 44:32.274
Make sure to apologize to her and compensate her properly.

591
44:33.192 --> 44:34.193
Yes, sir.

592
44:45.704 --> 44:46.830
Shall I call her back?

593
44:47.539 --> 44:48.499
Don't bother.

594
44:49.374 --> 44:50.375
We'll go separately.

595
45:39.591 --> 45:40.759
Mother, are you asleep?

596
45:48.851 --> 45:49.768
Stepmom.

597
45:53.730 --> 45:54.898
Hey, lady.

598
45:59.987 --> 46:01.363
I can't visit for a while.

599
46:04.199 --> 46:06.994
I've found something more interesting than watching you.

600
46:10.330 --> 46:11.206
Who is this woman?

601
46:11.290 --> 46:13.750
They looked pretty close. Maybe she's his girlfriend?

602
46:16.753 --> 46:18.338
Baek Ho-rang's girlfriend?

603
46:20.549 --> 46:22.342
Got any other photos of her?

604
46:22.426 --> 46:23.468
No, not yet.

605
46:26.263 --> 46:28.140
Follow him around the clock.

606
46:28.223 --> 46:29.558
-Okay? -Yes, sir.

607
46:30.225 --> 46:31.685
And find out more about her.

608
46:31.768 --> 46:32.603
Yes, sir.

609
46:34.104 --> 46:34.980
Cheers.

610
46:42.279 --> 46:44.823
Going all out already? You just had your appendix out.

611
46:44.907 --> 46:46.116
I'm fine now.

612
46:46.199 --> 46:48.410
Excuse me, could we get some chopsticks?

613
46:48.493 --> 46:50.579
Gonna drink till I drop. Don't stop me.

614
46:51.455 --> 46:54.041
What if Ji-hye gets mad at me for letting you drink?

615
46:54.124 --> 46:56.043
Your sister really scares me.

616
46:56.126 --> 46:57.336
It's okay. I moved out.

617
46:57.419 --> 46:59.004
Huh? When?

618
47:00.172 --> 47:01.006
Yesterday.

619
47:01.089 --> 47:01.924
No way. Damn.

620
47:02.007 --> 47:04.718
Why didn't you tell me?

621
47:05.636 --> 47:06.470
-Well… -Yeah?

622
47:07.429 --> 47:08.722
Actually…

623
47:09.681 --> 47:10.891
You're out of your mind.

624
47:11.475 --> 47:13.769
What if your sister and brother find out you lied?

625
47:13.852 --> 47:16.772
Your sister's gonna kill you if you keep this up.

626
47:16.855 --> 47:18.607
No. Listen.

627
47:19.107 --> 47:20.984
Say I spend three months with Mr. Baek,

628
47:21.068 --> 47:23.570
fulfill our contract, and finish my bucket list.

629
47:24.154 --> 47:25.614
Then I work it into my script.

630
47:25.697 --> 47:28.158
-Work it in. -Then I renew my writing contract.

631
47:28.241 --> 47:29.242
-Renew it. -Then…

632
47:31.036 --> 47:33.789
-It won't be a lie anymore. -What if they don't renew it?

633
47:35.374 --> 47:39.169
Your brother's moving to Daejeon. Your sister's moving in with her husband.

634
47:39.252 --> 47:41.880
And that chaebol will kick you out once the contract's up.

635
47:41.964 --> 47:43.840
Then what? You'll have nowhere to go.

636
47:43.924 --> 47:45.759
If they don't renew my contract,

637
47:46.259 --> 47:48.220
I'll have to move back in with my parents.

638
47:48.804 --> 47:49.680
No plan, huh?

639
47:52.015 --> 47:53.517
You're driving me up the wall.

640
47:54.101 --> 47:55.060
I have it worse.

641
47:55.143 --> 47:59.648
That chaebol whose name means "tiger." What if he finds out about your powers?

642
47:59.731 --> 48:02.317
You said he has no idea why you can charge his heart.

643
48:02.401 --> 48:06.446
He doesn't get zapped when I touch him. I don't think he'll ever find out.

644
48:06.530 --> 48:07.781
He just doesn't know yet.

645
48:07.864 --> 48:09.825
What are you gonna do

646
48:09.908 --> 48:13.412
if you get angry or too excited and blow out the lights?

647
48:14.454 --> 48:16.123
-You think so? -"You think so"?

648
48:18.375 --> 48:22.004
Hey, don't you know rich snobs sue at the drop of a hat?

649
48:22.087 --> 48:26.133
What if he sues you for lying about your powers?

650
48:27.300 --> 48:28.427
You're right.

651
48:28.510 --> 48:30.637
I have to make sure he never finds out.

652
48:54.327 --> 48:55.620
What time is it?

653
48:55.704 --> 48:57.956
Huh? We have to go.

654
48:59.041 --> 49:03.170
Hey, Bo-bae. Wake up.

655
49:03.837 --> 49:05.881
Hey, wake up. We have to go.

656
49:06.381 --> 49:08.925
Wake up.

657
49:10.135 --> 49:12.262
Sorry. We're leaving. Just a second.

658
49:12.345 --> 49:13.722
DIRECTOR YEOM MIN-KYU

659
49:16.433 --> 49:19.728
Well, if it isn't my favorite director!

660
49:20.228 --> 49:21.396
Right now?

661
49:22.272 --> 49:23.190
Yes.

662
49:24.357 --> 49:26.526
I had a few drinks, but I'm not that drunk.

663
49:27.527 --> 49:28.653
No.

664
49:28.737 --> 49:31.114
Yes, I'll be right there.

665
49:32.657 --> 49:35.285
What am I going to do with her? Seriously.

666
49:35.869 --> 49:39.081
Hey, wake up. We really have to go. Damn it.

667
49:40.332 --> 49:42.501
Crap. What am I supposed to do with her?

668
49:43.293 --> 49:44.461
Someone's calling her.

669
49:52.344 --> 49:54.971
You little punk! Perfect timing.

670
49:56.348 --> 49:57.349
Hey.

671
49:58.642 --> 50:00.769
Damn it. Seriously.

672
50:05.857 --> 50:07.109
-Eun-ho! Hey. -Ms. Cho.

673
50:07.192 --> 50:09.152
Eun-ho, thank you so much.

674
50:09.653 --> 50:11.238
I should take her home,

675
50:11.321 --> 50:13.698
but Director Yeom suddenly put me to work.

676
50:13.782 --> 50:14.741
-Right. -Yeah.

677
50:14.825 --> 50:16.493
I know you two are close, so…

678
50:16.576 --> 50:18.161
Yes, I'll take care of Bo-bae.

679
50:18.245 --> 50:19.871
Okay. Thank you so much.

680
50:19.955 --> 50:20.789
No problem.

681
50:21.957 --> 50:23.834
Oh, that's right.

682
50:23.917 --> 50:26.211
You know Bo-bae doesn't like being touched, right?

683
50:26.294 --> 50:27.963
-Yes. -Don't try to support her.

684
50:28.046 --> 50:30.507
Touch her through her clothes if you need to.

685
50:30.590 --> 50:33.343
Just wake her up and get her home, please.

686
50:33.426 --> 50:35.428
-Yes, got it. -Please look after her.

687
50:35.512 --> 50:36.638
Bye.

688
50:36.721 --> 50:38.598
Wake up already, Na Bo-bae!

689
50:38.682 --> 50:39.975
Go, damn it.

690
50:40.058 --> 50:41.893
Jeez, I'm off, then.

691
50:41.977 --> 50:43.061
All right.

692
50:44.980 --> 50:45.814
Bo-bae.

693
50:45.897 --> 50:47.357
Damn it.

694
50:49.067 --> 50:50.235
I mean…

695
50:50.861 --> 50:55.365
Just because he makes a lot of money and has a fancy business card,

696
50:55.448 --> 50:58.660
does he think he can treat a cleaner however he wants?

697
51:01.037 --> 51:02.622
Wow, she's really drunk.

698
51:04.749 --> 51:06.209
Why, you…

699
51:06.293 --> 51:07.127
Damn it.

700
51:11.298 --> 51:12.674
Bo-bae, let's go.

701
51:12.757 --> 51:15.010
You little…

702
51:15.719 --> 51:17.053
Let's go. Get up.

703
51:25.854 --> 51:27.189
Bo-bae, come here.

704
51:39.659 --> 51:40.493
Wow!

705
51:42.579 --> 51:43.496
Bo-bae!

706
51:50.795 --> 51:53.840
What if the battery dies? Why isn't she back yet? Damn it.

707
52:08.104 --> 52:09.940
I used to eat this a lot as a kid.

708
52:10.023 --> 52:12.609
You know what? He was my favorite.

709
52:13.401 --> 52:16.863
He can generate electricity too, and he's super strong.

710
52:17.364 --> 52:18.198
Me too.

711
52:18.782 --> 52:20.909
Bet that's why Pikachu is everyone's favorite.

712
52:27.916 --> 52:30.252
So you should stop hiding it from me and…

713
52:30.335 --> 52:31.169
What's this?

714
52:34.172 --> 52:35.590
RUBBER GLOVE

715
52:37.759 --> 52:38.718
"Rubber glove"?

716
52:40.387 --> 52:41.888
Forget it. I'm not answering.

717
52:42.389 --> 52:45.183
This douchebag. I can't stand the sight of him.

718
52:46.142 --> 52:49.688
Go on. So you like Pikachu too?

719
52:52.607 --> 52:53.441
Yes.

720
52:55.068 --> 52:56.152
Very much.

721
52:56.653 --> 52:59.990
I didn't know Pikachu was this popular.

722
53:00.782 --> 53:03.493
The person you're calling is unavailable.

723
53:03.576 --> 53:05.495
Please call back later.

724
53:05.578 --> 53:06.746
She's not picking up?

725
53:07.789 --> 53:08.623
PORTABLE CHARGER

726
53:08.707 --> 53:10.292
Come home right now.

727
53:11.042 --> 53:15.672
Get within a ten-meter radius of me!

728
53:20.719 --> 53:21.553
Read it.

729
53:24.472 --> 53:25.473
Don't tell me…

730
53:25.557 --> 53:27.976
Is she not gonna come back at all?

731
53:29.936 --> 53:33.189
Twenty-five hours since separating from Na Bo-bae.

732
53:38.361 --> 53:39.404
Dead.

733
53:40.113 --> 53:41.114
DEAD

734
53:50.540 --> 53:53.293
It's all just pointless worries.

735
53:54.127 --> 53:58.173
I need to clear my mind of distracting thoughts and worries.

736
54:09.809 --> 54:14.606
As you breathe in, feel positive energy fill you.

737
54:15.857 --> 54:21.905
As you breathe out, release all the negative energy.

738
54:23.406 --> 54:28.328
When you exhale, let go of the person troubling you.

739
54:29.579 --> 54:33.625
Mr. Baek Ho-rang. A power-tripping narcissist.

740
54:33.708 --> 54:35.335
You'd be dead without me.

741
54:35.418 --> 54:38.463
Scared? Anxious? Losing your mind?

742
54:38.963 --> 54:39.964
No!

743
54:42.926 --> 54:44.094
What the…

744
54:45.804 --> 54:46.930
Damn it.

745
54:59.984 --> 55:02.028
Bo-bae, you live here now?

746
55:02.112 --> 55:02.987
Yeah.

747
55:03.071 --> 55:04.447
Darn it.

748
55:05.198 --> 55:08.618
This thing's just like its owner. Damn it.

749
55:15.125 --> 55:16.084
Seriously…

750
55:19.337 --> 55:21.714
Bo-bae, I don't think this is the right place.

751
55:22.340 --> 55:24.509
It's way too big. Look again. Are you sure?

752
55:24.592 --> 55:26.553
It's the right place. Baek Ho--

753
55:26.636 --> 55:27.637
Our arrangement

754
55:28.138 --> 55:31.141
stays strictly between us.

755
55:34.853 --> 55:35.770
Actually, no.

756
55:35.854 --> 55:37.772
It's not here.

757
55:38.857 --> 55:40.442
Where is it? I'll take you home.

758
55:40.525 --> 55:42.527
No!

759
55:43.987 --> 55:46.322
It's the house next door. Right next door.

760
55:47.490 --> 55:49.117
I'm so drunk, aren't I?

761
55:53.955 --> 55:55.999
Here. This is it.

762
55:56.082 --> 55:57.834
I'll head in. Go on home, Eun-ho.

763
55:58.418 --> 56:00.003
-I'll go after you go-- -No!

764
56:01.296 --> 56:02.797
I'm home already. No need.

765
56:05.633 --> 56:09.262
Save those lovey-dovey eyes for your melodramas.

766
56:09.345 --> 56:11.556
When did I ever give you lovey-dovey eyes?

767
56:32.410 --> 56:35.038
I was just looking. You're the one who got butterflies.

768
56:48.051 --> 56:49.427
As if!

769
56:50.094 --> 56:52.639
I said go home. Go already!

770
56:52.722 --> 56:54.057
Okay, Bo-bae. Calm down.

771
56:54.140 --> 56:55.558
You need to calm down.

772
56:55.642 --> 56:57.393
-I'm off. -Yeah, bye.

773
56:57.477 --> 56:58.686
-Calm down, Bo-bae. -Yeah.

774
56:58.770 --> 57:01.689
I'm calming down right now, Eun-ho. Bye.

775
57:16.329 --> 57:17.789
I think he sometimes

776
57:18.289 --> 57:21.000
forgets I've been single my whole life.

777
57:25.547 --> 57:27.257
Damn.

778
57:28.758 --> 57:32.887
Crap, my heart's still pounding.

779
57:36.349 --> 57:37.934
That hurts.

780
57:38.017 --> 57:39.143
Oh God.

781
57:40.770 --> 57:42.981
Oh no! I'm bleeding!

782
57:45.108 --> 57:46.901
It hurts.

783
57:47.860 --> 57:49.529
Huh?

784
57:53.783 --> 57:54.617
What?

785
58:13.636 --> 58:14.971
Ms. Na Bo-bae?

786
58:16.806 --> 58:19.684
Oh no. What if I just caused a blackout?

787
58:22.270 --> 58:23.521
Damn it.

788
58:30.737 --> 58:31.654
Click.

789
58:34.532 --> 58:35.575
Pika.

790
58:37.410 --> 58:38.536
Pika.

791
58:39.787 --> 58:45.168
Pikachu!

792
58:51.716 --> 58:52.842
Why didn't it work?

793
58:54.552 --> 58:55.887
What's going on?

794
58:57.930 --> 59:00.433
Mr. Baek Ho-rang!

795
59:01.517 --> 59:02.435
Huh?

796
59:03.102 --> 59:05.605
Mr. Baek, did you fall?

797
59:06.773 --> 59:09.150
Oh no. What do I do?

798
59:11.194 --> 59:14.405
Mr. Baek Ho-rang, I'm coming!

799
59:14.489 --> 59:15.782
Hold on.

800
59:16.824 --> 59:18.993
Mr. Baek!

801
59:19.077 --> 59:19.911
I'll…

802
59:19.994 --> 59:23.081
Huh? Where is he?

803
59:24.165 --> 59:24.999
Huh?

804
59:25.500 --> 59:27.377
Here, right? Here!

805
59:27.460 --> 59:29.045
Don't open it!

806
59:29.921 --> 59:31.506
I told you not to come in!

807
59:31.589 --> 59:34.133
-Are you hurt? Are you okay? -Ms. Na!

808
59:34.217 --> 59:35.885
I'm not wearing anything right now!

809
59:35.968 --> 59:38.930
I can't see anything anyway.

810
59:41.307 --> 59:42.392
You're hurt.

811
59:42.475 --> 59:44.894
Hold my hand. Can you see it?

812
59:44.977 --> 59:47.438
Well, if I could, that'd be an even bigger problem!

813
59:48.356 --> 59:52.568
Hey, there's a bathrobe over there. Just hand it to me.

814
59:52.652 --> 59:55.071
-Bathrobe? -Yes, a bathrobe.

815
59:55.154 --> 59:56.322
It's here.

816
59:56.406 --> 59:57.281
Here.

817
59:57.365 --> 59:59.617
-Here. Grab it. -Okay.

818
59:59.701 --> 01:00:00.868
-Where is it? -Right here.

819
01:00:23.599 --> 01:00:24.809
You reek of alcohol.

820
01:00:25.393 --> 01:00:26.978
I'm sorry.

821
01:02:22.093 --> 01:02:26.681
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
